<p>
    <strong>Core Gameplan:</strong> Elves represents a highly favorable
    structural matchup. Once an <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Opalescence">Opalescence</a
    > plus <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Parallax Wave">Parallax Wave</a
    > lock hits the battlefield, their entire board is permanently
    exiled. Utilize early copies of <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Swords to Plowshares"
        >Swords to Plowshares</a
    > exclusively to sever foundational mana acceleration (<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Priest of Titania">Priest of Titania</a
    > or <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Rofellos, Llanowar Emissary">Rofellos</a
    >). While Elves possesses explosive combo potential,
    stabilizing into Turn 4 guarantees an insurmountable
    resource lock.
</p>
<p>
    <strong>Sideboard Strategy:</strong> Remove <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Tsabo's Web">Tsabo's Web</a
    > unless opposing lists display non-basic mana disruption like
    <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Rishadan Port">Rishadan Port</a
    > or <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Wasteland">Wasteland</a
    >. Trimming <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Meddling Mage">Meddling Mage</a
    > is acceptable to maximize reactive efficiency. Bring in additional
    spot removal (<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Swords to Plowshares"
        >Swords to Plowshares</a
    >), defensive sweepers (<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Wrath of God">Wrath of God</a
    >), and <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Seal of Cleansing">Seal of Cleansing</a
    > to combat post-board zero-mana interactions like <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Reverent Silence">Reverent Silence</a
    >.
</p>
